Package: a-nas-console
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: A-NAS <zhongwater123@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: a-nas-host (= @VERSION@), cage, chromium, chromium-sandbox, chromium-l10n, fonts-noto-cjk, wlr-randr, libinput-tools, intel-media-va-driver | mesa-va-drivers, vainfo
Description: the local console of an A-NAS device
 The Wayland kiosk that shows the Web desktop on the device's own screen
 (docs/adr/0005), and a VA-API driver for Chromium's hardware video decoding:
 Intel's unless AMD's (mesa-va-drivers) is installed already.
